        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s70f",
          "text": "Falls can be deadly under the wrong circumstances, such as if a hip fracture causes complications for a senior citizen like blood clots or infections. Even more minor injuries can result in thousands of dollars in medical expenses, temporary or permanent disability, and emotional distress for the victim.",
          "marks": []
        }
