    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b70i",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s70h",
          "text": "When Can You File a Slip and Fall Accident Lawsuit in Colorado?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b70n",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l70k",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/thornton-premises-liability-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s70j",
          "text": "You can file a premises liability lawsuit in Colorado for a slip and fall accident if one or more parties is responsible for causing or contributing to your fall. A premises liability claim seeks to hold a property owner legally and financially responsible (liable) for accidents that take place on the property due to negligence, or the failure to act with ordinary care. A slip and fall accident can occur due to an uneven surface, freshly mopped or waxed floor, broken staircase, food debris, or spilled liquid. If the property owner reasonably should have prevented the accident, such as by detecting and remedying the hazard sooner, the owner can be held liable. Our ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s70l",
          "text": "Thorton premises liability attorney",
          "marks": [
            "l70k"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s70m",
          "text": "s are ready to help file your claim and hold the property owner liable.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b70p",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s70o",
          "text": "How a Slip and Fall Attorney Can Help",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b70r",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s70q",
          "text": "A slip and fall accident lawyer in Thornton can help you in many vital ways during your premises liability lawsuit. First, your attorney can provide a comprehensive investigation of your accident to search for signs of fault or negligence. Then, your attorney can preserve and gather key evidence to support your claim, such as eyewitness statements and video surveillance footage.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b70t",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s70s",
          "text": "Next, your attorney can go up against an insurance company for you in pursuit of maximum financial compensation during settlement negotiations. Throughout the legwork of your case, your attorney will also provide emotional support by answering your questions, listening to your needs, and pursuing your goals using proven legal strategies.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
